    "chapter": "Vīthisaṅgaha (Chapter 4) Day 1",
    "question": "In pañcadvāravīthi, there are always atītabhavaṅgas, while in manodvāravīthi, atītabhavaṅgas can arise or not arise, what is the reason?",
