    "chapter": "Vīthimuttasaṅgaha (Chapter 5) Day 1",
    "question": "Translate these verses. Puthujjanā na labbhanti suddhāvāsesu sabbathā Sotāpannā ca sakadā- gāmino cā pi puggalā. Ariyā n’opalabbhanti asaññāpāyabhūmisu Sesaṭṭhānesu labbhanti ariyā’nariyā pi ca.",
