    "answer": "There are 5 requirements that make pāṇātipāta akusalakammapatha: 1. Pāṇo: Beings with life. 2. Pāṇasaññita: Knowing that being has life. 3. Vadhakacitaṁ: Having the intention to kill. 4. Payogo: The act of trying to kill. 5. Tena maraṇaṁ: That object dies because of that intention."
