    "question": "Write the four causes of death and their comparisons.",
    "answer": "The four causes of death are: 1)Āyukkhaya through the expiration of the lifespan. 2)Kammakkhaya through the expiration of the (productive) karmic force. 3)Ubhayakkhaya through the (simultaneous) expiration of both. 4)Upacchedaka through (the intervention of) destructive kamma. As an oil lamp may be extinguished -Due to the exhaustion of the wick (āyukkhaya). -Due to the exhaustion of the oil (kammakkhaya). -Due to the exhaustion of both (ubhayakkhaya). -Due to some extraneous cause, like a gust of wind (upacchedaka)."
