    "answer": "The four causes of death are: 1)Āyukkhaya through the expiration of the lifespan. 2)Kammakkhaya through the expiration of the (productive) karmic force. 3)Ubhayakkhaya through the (simultaneous) expiration of both. 4)Upacchedaka through (the intervention of) destructive kamma. Āyukkhayamaraṇa, kammakkhayamaraṇa and ubhayakkhayamaraṇa are kālamaraṇa. Upacchedakamaraṇa is akālamaraṇa."
